879","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s44879","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s44879","name":"外崎 剛","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130751","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c103515","characterName":"ピピ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c103515"},"originalCharacterName":"ピピ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"3"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yagami Coco's dog."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"A robot dog that Coco owns. In the Remake, she was created by Tanaka Youichi and designated LM-QSS17. Akanegasaki Sora describes PiPi as her \"younger sister,\" and the two share the same computer/body after the 2017 incident."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c103515"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c352167c36adfe369a3f2de94d9b1e088838b56e7ee13944ba22ab6c8128d93.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/4515eee2ddf009324ece0e8c8045c0a1c1ee262d2e568f4d2da587ff3801210f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c103516","characterName":"田中 陽一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c103516"},"originalCharacterName":"田中 陽一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tanaka Yubiseiharukana's father, who disappeared in 2000."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c103516"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b551be7597fae925cb94efc144258ed1343954011af8151c8abc5301c4f1c29f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/ebf46fb56da4a3e5014b10b71639cd4b7892e48197e05fccc9acc6570aff2bab.webp","width":180,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c149084","characterName":"守野 茂蔵博","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c149084"},"originalCharacterName":"守野 茂蔵博","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Izumi and Kurumi's father, the world-famous authority on genetic engineering. A man who participated in the Human Genome Project, a project with the goal to clarify the whole particulars of humans by analyzing the genomes they possessed. He made striking results on said project."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(Never7)"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He used cloning techniques at a time where cloning was still illegal to create Kurumi's clone ― Haruka."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(Ever17)"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He met Yubiseiharukana by chance when she was suffering from a severe heart disease and was on the verge of despair, and perhaps because he has two daughters close to her age, they eventually developed a father-daughter relationship. He convinced You, who had only a short time left to live, to give birth to a clone, and he offered to fully support her."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He has a deep knowledge of both Curé Syndrome and the Curé Virus."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"(From the Never7/Ever17 PSP-exclusive TIPS)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c149084"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山本 兼平","creatorId":"vndb:s31","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s31","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s31","name":"山本 兼平","roleCode":"voice-actor",