to speak of... but she is proud of her ability to bend spoons. But for all of these reasons, Coco is loved by those around her, impossible to dislike, that may in fact may be her special skill."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Walkthrough by Denethor0"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/752dac4282a09b368435b903cfe055e93a52c435de4defaa62a8e5645dac05f2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/48bf2a720382a9f18e578e31641ea949933b5588d2ba0b678339e47e805b6407.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"望月 久代","creatorId":"vndb:s1588","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1588","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1588","name":"望月 久代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:69568","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c28","characterName":"田中 優美清春香菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c28"},"originalCharacterName":"田中 優美清春香菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"330"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A freshman at Kyumeikan Women's University intending to major in archeology, and a part-time worker at LeMU. Her father gave her this unique first name because Tanaka was a common surname but very rare as a first name. She also possesses a wealth of occult-related knowledge and skills to survive in an emergency. More than anything, she loves to talk. Her nickname is \"You.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Walkthrough by Denethor0"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the young \"Tanaka You\" in 2017 LeMU incident and the grown-up \"Dr. Tanaka\" in the 2034 LeMU incident. By 2034, she is 35 years old but physically 23 years old, and she is pretending to be her own mother, \"Tanaka Yukie.\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c28"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/ea45cffb95df5232654c6a556543e0dd76690c6b50cd69580de68aced9743c81.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af4f093c2e268261972437063ccb0d4c4f0c888be3099074939e8b2949b637b9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"下屋 則子","creatorId":"vndb:s71","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s71","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s71","name":"下屋則子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:69561","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29","characterName":"田中 優美清秋香菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29"},"originalCharacterName":"田中 優美清秋香菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"922"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A freshman at Kyumeikan Women's University intending to major in archeology, and a part-time worker at LeMU. Her father gave her this unique first name because Tanaka was a common surname but very rare as a first name. She also possesses a wealth of occult-related knowledge and skills to survive in an emergency. More than anything, she loves to talk. Her nickname is \"You.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Walkthrough by Denethor0"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the young \"Tanaka You\" in 2034 LeMU incident and the daughter/clone of the original \"Tanaka You\" (You'haru') of the 2017 LeMU incident."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30b27b65a73c118a3d16b39f647637b945b24648d069d340f387c2b2a5b38a8b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/2242ed16b4a2c9dc561f17cb69c94c9481090721c62ee94b3b6f64336a7e3900.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"下屋 則子","creatorId":"vndb:s71","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s71","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s71","name":"下屋則子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:69562","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c30","characterName":"小町 つぐみ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c30"},"originalCharacterName":"小町 つぐみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"705"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl of few words, shrouded in mystery. Why has she come to LeMU?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Who, or what, is she? Her cold eyes seem as though they can peer right into the hearts of people and she regularly has harsh words for others. Just when it appears that she might open up, she lets loose with a flood of anger. What is the secret that this strange girl possesses?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Walkthrough by Denethor0"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her body is eternally 17, but in 2017 she is 23 years old, and in 2034 she is 40 years old. In 2017 she, with Kuranari Takeshi, conceived the twins Hokuto and Matsunaga Sara."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf9de0feff18f15ef00653afeda9c8633b175bc64f78aa83e7ec24aad97d66f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/464dc47ee1f6cdf4764c25cb5fd386d37403cd9d4550fe09a87c880037259946.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅川 悠","creatorId":"vndb:s81","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s81","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s81","name":"浅川 悠","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:69563","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31","characterName":"松永 沙羅","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31"},"originalCharacterName":"松永 沙羅","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"121"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sara is a second year student at Kyumeikan Girl's High School. Before graduating, Tanaka You was also a student there and Sara's senpai. She may not look it, but she is an experienced hacker, capable of breaking into nearly any computer system. Sara is also obsessed with ninja and ninjutsu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sara came to LeMU on a class field trip, but now she is stranded along with the other characters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is the daughter of Komachi Tsugumi and Kuranari Takeshi, from their relationship in 2017, and Hokuto's younger twin sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad6382601b11cec2c94313e130b2f60cf4cc63808023f54f13e6ca835b8b6ba6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e0c34ec44fb4e5b837fd2875c8f33e6e919650e88c488c40676c4806caf92001.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"植田 佳奈","creatorId":"vndb:s17","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17","name":"植田 佳奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:69559","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c32","characterName":"茜ヶ崎 空","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c32"},"originalCharacterName":"茜ヶ崎 空","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"402"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only full-time staff member of LeMU to be stranded, Sora is a professional computer engineer,"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"as well as the main AI. Although she is an AI, she can think on her own, as"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"she tries her best to get everyone stranded on LeMU to safety."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She thinks rationally at all times, not allowing emotions to sway her decisions."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is programmed to act 24 years old."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes flowers, animals, and anything living in nature."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her official designation is LM-RSDS-4913A in the original, and LM-QS16 in the remake."}],